     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>If it snowed last night, then today we will go skiing.</p>\n<p>The given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Last night it snowed.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: Today we will go skiing.</p>\n<p>Break down the compound statement into its components.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Last night it snowed</td>\n<td>conditional</td>\n<td>today we will go skiing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"p\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\" \\to \"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"q\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span> <span data-math=\" \\to \"></span> <span data-math=\"p\"></span></p>\n"
    }
